WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.380
Dedicated sukkah materials have restrictions on ordinary

00:00:03.380 --> 00:00:03.840
use.

00:00:04.120 --> 00:00:07.400
Keep other supplies nearby, removing tempting shortcuts

00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:09.160
makes it easier to respect what has

00:00:09.160 --> 00:00:09.880
been set aside.
